  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1">Read SendEmailDialog's wrapLookup/yieldToSidePane and sidePaneLayering end to end; read WizardShell's modal mode and the PCF and DRV launch paths.</step>
    <step order="2">Let WizardShell's modal mode accept the yield option (opt-in) and have DocumentEmailWizard's composer wrap its lookup handlers the way SendEmailDialog does.</step>
    <step order="3">Make the outer FindSimilarViewerDialog yield while the DRV's lookup is open (or open the DRV top-level); record the choice.</step>
    <step order="4">Bump the SemanticSearchControl version in every location and build with build:prod; build the DRV code page.</step>
    <step order="5">Write the tests in the acceptance criteria; run them, the touched folders' suites, `npx tsc --noEmit -p .` in Spaarke.UI.Components and `node scripts/quality/client-lint/client-lint.mjs check`.</step>
    <step order="6">Update tasks/TASK-INDEX.md status to `✅ [done]` AND this POML's status to completed; run `pwsh scripts/check-task-status-drift.ps1 -Project spaarke-ontology-platform-r1`. Record deviations in notes/task-194-notes.md.</step>
  </steps>
  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Test: when the DocumentEmailWizard recipient lookup starts, the WizardShell modal is lowered under the side pane; when it resolves (pick or cancel) or throws, the modal is restored.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Test: a pick returns chips; Cancel keeps the earlier recipients; a lookup failure behaves as cancel (no crash, earlier recipients kept).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Test: WizardShell without the new option renders and layers exactly as before (existing WizardShell and SendEmailDialog tests unchanged and passing).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">DRV via Semantic Search: the outer dialog yields while the lookup is open and is restored after (test where feasible; otherwise a recorded manual check).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">SemanticSearchControl version bumped in every location; build:prod output shows success; the DRV code page builds.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">wizardLookupPatternGuard.test.ts passes with its baseline unchanged; tsc and the client-lint ratchet pass.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>
  <escalation>
    <trigger>If neither yielding the outer dialog nor a top-level DRV launch works without changing how the DRV opens from forms, STOP and report the options.</trigger>
    <trigger>If the fix needs a change to sidePaneLayering's contract that other hosts depend on, STOP and report.</trigger>
  </escalation>
  <ui-tests>
    <test name="Lookup above the wizard">
      <steps>
        <step>Matter form → Semantic Search → select a document → Email → Compose; click To, Cc, Bcc</step>
        <step>Same from the Document Relationship Viewer opened from Semantic Search Find Similar, and from a form</step>
      </steps>
      <expected>The side pane appears above the wizard; picks show as chips; Cancel keeps earlier picks; the wizard is usable again afterwards. Light and dark.</expected>
    </test>
  </ui-tests>
  <tools>
    <tool name="npm">jest, tsc and ESLint in src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components; PCF `npm run build:prod` (build ../Spaarke.SdapClient then Spaarke.UI.Components first in a fresh worktree; do not run PCF builds in parallel with the shared-lib build)</tool>
  </tools>
  <execution>
    <protocol>Run through task-execute. Fresh worktree from origin/master; PR to master. Starts after 195 merges or before it, never in parallel with it.</protocol>
  </execution>
</task>
